1. WHAT THIS COVERS

"The Verbum Material" means everything in this project that was created for
Verbum and is not listed in NOTICE.md as third-party material, including:

  (a) the source code, build scripts, styling and configuration;
  (b) the visual design, layout, icons and artwork made for Verbum;
  (c) the original writing made for Verbum: chapter summaries and notes, book
      cards, glossary entries, chapter stories, reading paths, journeys and
      their stop notes, timeline notes, painting guides and all other text
      in the app that is not the Bible text or a quotation; and
  (d) the selection, arrangement and presentation of all of the above.

